{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00100",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 0.65,
      "end_seconds": 9.3,
      "duration_seconds": 8.65,
      "text": "Doctor, the patient's with us now. I did the usual checks at the front, so just say when you want them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.99,
      "end_seconds": 13.42,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Perfect, thanks. Hello there, so what's the trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 14.23,
      "end_seconds": 22.8,
      "duration_seconds": 8.57,
      "text": "Good morning, doctor. I came along to help out. He's been having swollen ankles in the evening, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.89,
      "end_seconds": 27.56,
      "duration_seconds": 2.67,
      "text": "How long have you had it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 28.37,
      "end_seconds": 37.78,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "Hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the date."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.39,
      "end_seconds": 49.14,
      "duration_seconds": 9.75,
      "text": "Alright, tell me a bit more about it: how bad it gets, how often, and whether anything makes it better or worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 53.15,
      "end_seconds": 65.88,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "Hmm, it's once or twice a day. I get some relief from raising the legs. I notice it more with standing all day. Mostly moderate."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.81,
      "end_seconds": 73.38,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "I was just going to say that the main thing is—"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 73.48,
      "end_seconds": 79.91,
      "duration_seconds": 6.43,
      "text": "Sorry to cut in, doctor, quick question: shall I bring the trolley in now or later?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.01,
      "end_seconds": 83.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Later, thanks. Please go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.39,
      "end_seconds": 93.88,
      "duration_seconds": 8.49,
      "text": "And, And tight shoes by the end of the day as well, you know, since Monday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 94.75,
      "end_seconds": 100.94,
      "duration_seconds": 6.19,
      "text": "Have you had swollen ankles in the evening before, or is this the first time?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.79,
      "end_seconds": 111.94,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Um, yes, something like this happened about six months ago, and it went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 113.39,
      "end_seconds": 123.21,
      "duration_seconds": 9.82,
      "text": "Doctor, I've got the readings for you. Temperature is 36.8 degrees, pressure 172 over 98, pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.19,
      "end_seconds": 126.3,
      "duration_seconds": 1.11,
      "text": "Okay, noted."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.02,
      "end_seconds": 132.09,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "If you're comfortable, I'll examine you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 133.92,
      "end_seconds": 137.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.78,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 153.94,
      "end_seconds": 157.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.58,
      "text": "Chest is clear and the neck veins aren't raised."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.32,
      "end_seconds": 162.1,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "So, bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.78,
      "end_seconds": 179.31,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Mild pitting swelling around both ankles, equal on both sides."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 184.93,
      "end_seconds": 190.41,
      "duration_seconds": 5.48,
      "text": "That's fine, sit up. Any reduced urine, breathlessness lying flat or weight gain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 191.02,
      "end_seconds": 205.01,
      "duration_seconds": 13.99,
      "text": "No, no reduced urine, no breathlessness lying flat, no weight gain. I did have a heavy feeling in the legs at one point, but that went away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.72,
      "end_seconds": 210.63,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "What about one leg more swollen than the other?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 211.87,
      "end_seconds": 217.65,
      "duration_seconds": 5.78,
      "text": "I, I haven't noticed any one leg more swollen than the other."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.62,
      "end_seconds": 222.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "Right, and what about calf pain or chest pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 224.58,
      "end_seconds": 226.52,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Nothing like that, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 230.91,
      "end_seconds": 234.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.5,
      "text": "So, any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 235.58,
      "end_seconds": 237.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.14,
      "end_seconds": 243.38,
      "duration_seconds": 4.24,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.56,
      "end_seconds": 249.51,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "No weakness or anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 250.83,
      "end_seconds": 254.94,
      "duration_seconds": 4.11,
      "text": "Any medication at the moment, including things from the pharmacy?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 256.74,
      "end_seconds": 268.15,
      "duration_seconds": 11.41,
      "text": "It's telmisartan, 40 milligrams, once a day. My sister suggested writing things down, but I forgot. I'm on escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 268.69,
      "end_seconds": 276.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.08,
      "text": "He is supposed to take it once a day, but I can't say he always does."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.4,
      "end_seconds": 282.42,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "Right, any long-term health problems I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 283.37,
      "end_seconds": 301.99,
      "duration_seconds": 18.62,
      "text": "I've, I've got high blood pressure. I did try to ignore it for a while. It's the not knowing that gets to me. I've got anxiety. I've never really been one for hospitals. Yes, heart disease."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 303.96,
      "end_seconds": 310.5,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Okay, I can see high blood pressure in your file as well. So, how about smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 311.11,
      "end_seconds": 314.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.44,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.36,
      "end_seconds": 318.78,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "And what do you usually eat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 320.2,
      "end_seconds": 323.27,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Mostly home-cooked food, rice and vegetables."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 324.2,
      "end_seconds": 326.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "Any operations in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 332.03,
      "end_seconds": 337.08,
      "duration_seconds": 5.05,
      "text": "Just a stent put in my heart, two years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.66,
      "end_seconds": 343.26,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "Any relatives with health problems I should be aware of?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.94,
      "end_seconds": 347.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "My father had a stroke."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.82,
      "end_seconds": 351.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.92,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 352.62,
      "end_seconds": 364.79,
      "duration_seconds": 12.17,
      "text": "Hmm, there was some antibiotic, I was told I was allergic. But I couldn't tell you what it was called or what it did."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 377.07,
      "end_seconds": 390.35,
      "duration_seconds": 13.28,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, I'd lean towards ankle swelling possibly from a blood pressure tablet. It could also be heart-related fluid retention, so we'll keep that open. A venous problem is still possible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 408.75,
      "end_seconds": 413.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.86,
      "text": "We should do a urine protein test for leg swelling."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_5",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 415.53,
      "end_seconds": 419.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.07,
      "text": "We have a slot Wednesday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 421.0,
      "end_seconds": 423.81,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "Wednesday, that works for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 425.63,
      "end_seconds": 442.59,
      "duration_seconds": 16.96,
      "text": "I think an echocardiogram makes sense here, for leg swelling. Raise your legs when you're sitting and try compression socks. Let's plan a check in three weeks. Okay, I think we're finished. Is everything clear?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_4",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 443.09,
      "end_seconds": 447.55,
      "duration_seconds": 4.46,
      "text": "That's everything I wanted to ask. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}